  "description": "Cha Ju-Yeon, a third-generation chaebol heir with flawless looks. He is Hui-Su’s boyfriend and seems perfect, but he has a fatal flaw: he’s a notorious womanizer. One day, as Hui-Su grows weary of his repeated infidelities, top singer-songwriter Kwon Do-Han approaches him.\n\n *“Use me. I’ll make you feel so good that you won’t be able to think about anything else.”*\n\nAn SM game he started just to provoke Cha Ju-Yeon. Hui-Su finds himself increasingly drawn into this precarious escapade... \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
